# 仓库行尾规范：统一为 LF，Windows 批处理除外
#
# 背景：此前仓库是 CRLF/LF 混合（421 纯LF / 47 纯CRLF / 21 混合），
# core.autocrlf=false。编辑器或工具一旦把某个文件整体规范化，git diff
# 就会显示全文件重写，淹没真实改动。此文件锁死规则，防止复发。
#
# .bat/.cmd 保持 CRLF：cmd.exe 解析 LF 行尾的批处理在 goto/label 等场景
# 有已知问题，改动可能让 miniqmt.bat 控制台异常。

* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows 批处理必须保持 CRLF
*.bat   text eol=crlf
*.cmd   text eol=crlf
*.ps1   text eol=crlf

# 二进制文件不做任何行尾转换
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.gif   binary
*.ico   binary
*.pdf   binary
*.xlsx  binary
*.xls   binary
*.db    binary
*.pyd   binary
*.dll   binary
*.so    binary
*.zip   binary
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf   binary
